    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb top floor two-bedroom apartment to the market in the ever-popular Ard Cluain development, Clonee, Co. Meath. Ard Cluain is a modern and well-maintained development ideally positioned in the heart of Clonee Village, with an excellent selection of local amenities on its doorstep including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, supermarkets and leisure facilities. Dunboyne Tennis Club adjoins the development, while nearby Ongar Village, Dunboyne and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre provide an even greater choice of retail and recreational amenities. The area is exceptionally well connected with easy access to the M3 and M50 motorways, Dublin Airport is within a 20-minute drive, and excellent public transport links together with Dunboyne Train Station make commuting to Dublin City Centre quick and convenient.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation extending to approximately c. 75 sq.m briefly comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, two generous double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, a modern family bathroom and master ensuite with an open plan living/dining area and fully fitted kitchen.  The open living space provides access to a private SOUTH-West facing balcony, providing the perfect space to relax or dine outdoors.\n\nNo. 34 comes to the market in TURN KEY condition throughout and further benefits from lift access, designated parking in a gated carpark, and a highly convenient village centre location. This superb property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors and those looking to downsize alike.\n\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n\n* 2 BED / 2 BATH PENTHOUSE\n* B RATED BER qualifying of a Green Mortgage\n* c. 75 sq.m\n* TURN KEY Condition\n* South West facing Balcony\n* Bright and spacious living accommodation\n* Open plan living/kitchen/dining area\n* Two double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n* Lift access\n* Designated parking\n* Well-maintained development\n* Prime village centre location\n* Dunboyne Tennis Club adjacent to the development\n* Close to Clonee Village, Ongar Village & Blanchardstown Shopping Centre\n* Easy access to the M3 & M50 motorways\n* Excellent public transport links and Dunboyne Train Station nearby\n* Ideal for first-time buyers, investors and downsizers\n* Viewing highly advised\n\nDirections:\n\nEircode = D15HW74\n"
      },
      {
